# minimp3 — a public-domain (CC0) single-header MP3 decoder.
#
# MM6 ships its music as ordinary MP3 files, so playing them needs a decoder
# rather than reverse engineering. Pinned to a commit: the project has no
# releases, and an unpinned master would make builds unreproducible.
